senses.gloss:
जन्मन् + .{@-अधिपः@}
—1 an epithet of Śiva.
—2 the regent of a constellation under which a person is born (in astrology);
 होराजन्माधिपयोर्जन्मर्क्षे वाशुभो राज्ञः Bṛ. S. 34. 11.

जन्मन् + .{@-प्रतिष्ठा@}
—1 a birth-place.
—2 a mother; Ś. 6 (between verses 9th and 10th).

जन्मन् + .{@-स्थानम्@}
—1 birth-place, native country, home.
—2 the womb.
